=\"ital\">p.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">φῦσα</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Corinn.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">21 Bgk</span>. <span class=\"ital\">Pf. part.\nfém. ion.</span> <span class=\"grec\">πεφυκυίη,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 56 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">pf. épq.</span> <span class=\"grec\">πέφυα,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> <span class=\"ital\">3 pl.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πεφύασι</span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ᾱ</span>] <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 484 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 128 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">728 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">part. acc. pl.</span> <span class=\"grec\">πεφυῶτας,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 477</span>.\n<span class=\"ital\">Pl. q. pf. 1 sg. poét.</span> <span class=\"grec\">πεφύκειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 109 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">3 pl. poét.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἐπέφυκον</span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ῡ</span>] (<span class=\"ital\">p.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἐπεφύκεσαν</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">152,</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span> <span class=\"refch\">149,</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Sc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">76</span>.\n<span class=\"ital\">Ne pas confondre</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἔφυσαν,</span> <span class=\"ital\">3 pl. ao. 1,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.R.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">436,</span> <span class=\"ital\">et</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἔφυσαν,</span> <span class=\"ital\">3 pl. ao.\n2,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hh.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ven.</span> <span class=\"refch\">265 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thcr.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Idyl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">22, 21